      "favourites_count": 10,
      "description": "<p>This is vortex extension allowing you to manage mods in a modern way.\nJust add game in vortex, drag &amp; drop your downloaded mod archives and you’re ready to go.</p>\n<p>Installation:</p>\n<p>Open Vortex.\nGo to Extensions tab.\nDrag &amp; drop downloaded archive of extension into the Drag &amp; Drop area.\nInstall extension.\nRestart Vortex.\nGo to Games tab.\nSearch for SPT.\nClick on manage in found SPT extension.\nSelect folder with SPT, click Next until you have added managed game.</p>\n<p>How to install mods:</p>\n<p>Select game you added and drag &amp; drop downloaded mods archives into drag &amp; drop area below.</p>\n",
